# KAMMagneticBarrier

Root of the certificate application `KAMMagneticBarrier`: MAG: the magnetic field-line barrier at
eps = 3/2500 (D66, D68). An opt-in library (decision D51): a plain `lake build` does not build it;
`lake build KAMMagneticBarrier` does, through the serial capped driver. This file imports the
generated parts `KAMMagneticBarrier.*`, which together import every module that
`scripts/build_roots.json` assigns to `KAMMagneticBarrier`, except the frozen theorem anchors that
are still `DRAFT_SORRY` and their provider modules (built through the library's globs). It is
generated by `scripts/gen_root_imports.py`; do not edit it by hand, and never import it.
